wildos-office (0.1.2) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Every Write and Tables ribbon tab follows the design: Home gains Grow
    and Shrink font, Clear formatting, Borders and an Editing group;
    Insert gains Pages; Layout gains Page, Watermark and Remove breaks;
    References gains Citations and Index; Review gains Language.
  * View's Show items are checkboxes, the ribbon folds to its tab row with
    the chevron at its right, and the style gallery has up, down and
    expand at its right.
  * Ribbon icons follow the text colour instead of the accent.
  * File > Recent shows each file's app icon, folder and date, for Write
    and Tables files together.
  * Save as, Save a copy, Open and Export use the Wild OS file dialog.
  * Print shows its preview on the left with the printer, copies, pages,
    sides and page set-up on the right, and the rest under More options.
  * Dialogs: 32 px buttons and fields, the main button filled with the
    accent, plain group headings and underline tabs.
  * Tables: Margins opens Page settings on the Page tab.

 -- Wild OS Developers <dev@wildos.io>  Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:59:02 +0000

